•sufficiency of our financial and other resources to complete the necessary clinical trials;

•the results from ALTITUDE-AD and future clinical trials of sabirnetug;

•the frequency and severity of adverse effects related to sabirnetug;

•the ability of third-party manufacturers to manufacture supplies of sabirnetug and to develop, validate and maintain a commercial-scale manufacturing process that is compliant with current good manufacturing practices, or cGMPs;

