•whether we are required by the FDA, EMA or other regulatory authorities to conduct additional clinical trials prior to the approval to market sabirnetug and whether the FDA, EMA or other regulatory authorities may disagree with the number, design, endpoints, size, conduct, implementation or other aspects of our clinical trials;

